### GET all items
GET http://localhost:5000/items HTTP/1.1

### GET item by ID
GET http://localhost:5000/items/2 HTTP/1.1

### GET item by ID (non-existent)
GET http://localhost:5000/items/999 HTTP/1.1

### POST new item
POST http://localhost:5000/items HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "New Item"
}

### DELETE item by ID
DELETE http://localhost:5000/items/3 HTTP/1.1

### DELETE item by ID (non-existent)
DELETE http://localhost:5000/items/999 HTTP/1.1